      <title>Hugging Face 主动接触黄仁勋，Nvidia 近 130 亿美元收购开源 AI 平台</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260903/Hugging-Face-%E4%B8%BB%E5%8A%A8%E6%8E%A5%E8%A7%A6%E9%BB%84%E4%BB%81%E5%8B%8BNvidia-%E8%BF%91-130-%E4%BA%BF%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E6%94%B6%E8%B4%AD%E5%BC%80%E6%BA%90-AI-%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%B0/</link>
